{"chapter": "criteria", "node_kind": "section_title", "parent_tag": "05XX", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\section{", "suffix": "}\n\\label{section-algebraic}"}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:31a6bc1ad4de9aa03057a09f7b3374d4d29bd9b9633f141710da335b08d036dc", "source_text": "Algebraic morphisms", "source_text_hash": "sha256:0f65de3297b3a888b2b2f6d80f0c99e41f6b0362fc49b2bde357377d6cff6d92", "unit_id": "tag:05XX:title"}
{"chapter": "criteria", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "05XX", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:827083ade2fa6cca3ac2f8c7f144300c55d32d7d9ffbcd96fc5b19176676e811", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nThe following notion is occasionally useful.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:db5233a3e59a85a7e4c38690402a349203af9e0b463d18386b5d77de3198c6be", "unit_id": "tag:05XX:prose-0001"}
{"chapter": "criteria", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "05XX", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$S$", "MATH_0002": "$F : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0003": "$1$", "MATH_0004": "$(\\Sch/S)_{fppf}$", "MATH_0005": "$F$", "MATH_0006": "$T$", "MATH_0007": "$\\xi$", "MATH_0008": "$\\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0009": "$T$", "MATH_0010": "$2$", "MATH_0011": "$$\n(\\Sch/T)_{fppf} \\times_{\\xi, \\mathcal{Y}} \\mathcal{X}\n$$", "MATH_0012": "$S$", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-algebraic}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:8471cb68501f52f796e854ceecad9dc07f60028d4bfd6c53216f29f4ef53dfd8", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:e5f344cc72c961066e4d886fbb84aaecc4b2a4d08a026e2e3f8bdcbedefc6541", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a scheme. Let <MATH_0002> be a\n<MATH_0003>-morphism of stacks in groupoids over <MATH_0004>.\nWe say that <MATH_0005> is <TEXTITOPEN_0001>algebraic<TEXTITCLOSE_0001> if for every scheme <MATH_0006> and every\nobject <MATH_0007> of <MATH_0008> over <MATH_0009> the <MATH_0010>-fibre product\n<MATH_0011>\nis an algebraic stack over <MATH_0012>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:18d390f5b0594389ac95bbba88c487a80bc92f9f733be166a28913380d0fc0c5", "unit_id": "tag:06CF:statement"}
{"chapter": "criteria", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "05XX", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{algebraic-lemma-representable-morphism-to-algebraic}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:01e2df6aae8b1ae03970580e868e00e6650eefa1505e49eec5b27697c3bf6ef2", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nWith this terminology in place we have the following result that generalizes\nAlgebraic Stacks, Lemma\n<REF_0001>.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:d9a7cd2a58cbcf4bb03e73d0026602c3af96f65e509612b4236029d4c1e81a89", "unit_id": "tag:05XX:prose-0002"}
{"chapter": "criteria", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "05XX", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$S$", "MATH_0002": "$F : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0003": "$1$", "MATH_0004": "$(\\Sch/S)_{fppf}$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0006": "$F$", "MATH_0007": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-algebraic-morphism-to-algebraic}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:8854a82fefc20bd62628f8f51ddd7a4a759f76e678a859fe6b9fdf6ccb000665", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:62843ce631f68b7a64c3b275942fb12993b3c2710faf4e5a1485657b0395fecd", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a scheme.\nLet <MATH_0002> be a <MATH_0003>-morphism of\nstacks in groupoids over <MATH_0004>. If\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0005> is an algebraic stack, and\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0006> is algebraic (see above),\n<STRUCT_0004>\nthen <MATH_0007> is an algebraic stack.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:873f0f6154d053bfce03c0203485736c17f98bab8310059903a5aed73500876e", "unit_id": "tag:05XY:statement"}
{"chapter": "criteria", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "05XX", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$T$", "MATH_0002": "$\\xi$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0004": "$T$", "MATH_0005": "$1$", "MATH_0006": "$\\xi : (\\Sch/T)_{fppf} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0007": "$\\mathcal{U} = (\\Sch/T)_{fppf} \\times_{\\xi, \\mathcal{Y}} \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0008": "$U$", "MATH_0009": "$1$", "MATH_0010": "$(\\Sch/U)_{fppf} \\to \\mathcal{U}$", "MATH_0011": "$\\mathcal{U} \\longrightarrow \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0012": "$\\xi : (\\Sch/T)_{fppf} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0013": "$(\\Sch/U)_{fppf} \\to \\mathcal{U} \\to \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0014": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{algebraic-lemma-base-change-representable-transformations-property}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{algebraic-lemma-composition-representable-transformations-property}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{algebraic-lemma-smooth-surjective-morphism-implies-algebraic}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:f51d2c32c638376b0c69cf52121161404828b9bd14d84860d110f9f817674a5d", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:3b10b1e3c6211beaef87b95403cf72d71f242c4dc102bbcdcd0709253048f397", "source_text": "By assumption (1) there exists a scheme <MATH_0001> and an object\n<MATH_0002> of <MATH_0003> over <MATH_0004> such that the corresponding\n<MATH_0005>-morphism <MATH_0006>\nis smooth an surjective. Then\n<MATH_0007>\nis an algebraic stack by assumption (2).\nChoose a scheme <MATH_0008> and a surjective smooth <MATH_0009>-morphism\n<MATH_0010>.\nThe projection <MATH_0011>\nis, as the base change of the morphism\n<MATH_0012>,\nsurjective and smooth, see\nAlgebraic Stacks, Lemma\n<REF_0001>.\nThen the composition\n<MATH_0013>\nis surjective and smooth as a composition of surjective and smooth\nmorphisms, see\nAlgebraic Stacks, Lemma\n<REF_0002>.\nHence <MATH_0014> is an algebraic stack by\nAlgebraic Stacks, Lemma\n<REF_0003>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:5f326a009aa85fd5ec3c5dc58f7ef5a4fe02a02235d5ed9aadd413eadc42f338", "unit_id": "tag:05XY:proof"}
